            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "aliciamarie"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I agree with a previous review that said it didn't have really any green tea flavor. That being said I do love a good vanilla cream frappucino. Next time i would just use milk instead of tea.",
