            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jennifer Baker"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was nice, but didn't taste like the Starbucks green tea frappuccino that inspired it. Green tea powder would probably make it taste more authentic. Regardless, my daughter and I enjoyed the flavor. Be sure the brewed green tea is completely chilled so you don't melt the other ingredients, and we didn't use all of the sugar listed. This is a nice change from heavier milkshakes! Thanks for sharing your recipe.",
